---
import rooftopPool from '../assets/jade-allen-cook-mai-abe-utah-snow-rooftop-pool.png';
import jadeSelfie from '../assets/jade-allen-cook-selfie-san-jose-fountain.png';
import ButtonLink from '../components/button-link.astro';
import Header from '../components/header.astro';
import { primaryCtas } from '../components/nav-links';
import SectionSpacer from '../components/section-spacer.astro';
import Section from '../components/section.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/default-layout.astro';
---

<Layout image={rooftopPool}>
  <Header
    heading="Software Engineer & Content Creator"
    eyebrow="I've built for millions of users. The ones I think about most are the ones I almost missed."
    image={jadeSelfie}
    imageAlt="Jade Allen Cook selfie in front of the San Jose fountain."
  >
    <p>
      The web and I have grown up together, and more than fifteen years of
      building for it have shaped how I create inclusive digital experiences
      today. My work blends inclusive interfaces and scalable design systems to
      help teams deliver products that are both high quality and easy to use.
      From early planning and design through implementation and launch, each
      project is guided by clean code, thoughtful collaboration, and a belief
      that technology should meet people where they are.
    </p>
    <div>
      <ButtonLink href={primaryCtas.contentShoot.href} external>
        {primaryCtas.contentShoot.label}
      </ButtonLink>
      <ButtonLink
        href={primaryCtas.recruiterCall.href}
        external
        isSecondary={true}
      >
        {primaryCtas.recruiterCall.label}
      </ButtonLink>
    </div>
  </Header>

  <SectionSpacer />

  <Section
    id="software-engineering-cta"
    heading="Looking to Hire a Software Engineer?"
    eyebrow="Fifteen years of building for the web, from Apple to Google to PlayStation."
  >
    <p>
      Software engineering is the career that's funded all of this, building
      accessible, scalable products for companies large and small. If you're
      hiring, or just curious about that side of the work, I put together a page
      that covers all of it: the companies, the projects, and the experience
      behind them.
    </p>
    <ButtonLink href="/software-engineering">
      See My Software Engineering Work
    </ButtonLink>
  </Section>

  <SectionSpacer />
</Layout>
